# The behavioural suites live in adspaceplt/digital-form-tests, a PRIVATE
# repository, because this one is public and they carry the schema, the
# stand-in for it and the whole harness. `tests` here is a symlink to a
# clone of that repository and is never committed:
#
#   git clone https://github.com/adspaceplt/digital-form-tests /home/user/digital-form-tests
#   ln -sfn /home/user/digital-form-tests /home/user/digital-form/tests
#
# Ignored with and without the slash: a symlink is not a directory, so
# `tests/` alone does not match it and the link showed up untracked.
tests
tests/
